{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_237_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_237","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_237_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_237","textTraditional":"九年春王二月，葬杞僖公。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_237_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_237","textTraditional":"宋皇瑗帥師取鄭師于雍丘。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_237_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_237","textTraditional":"夏，楚人伐陳。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_237_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_237","textTraditional":"秋，宋公伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_237_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_237","textTraditional":"冬十月。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_237_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_237","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_237_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_237","textTraditional":"九年春，齊侯使公孟綽辭師于吳。吳子曰：「昔歲寡人聞命，今又革之，不知所從，將進受命於君。」","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_237_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_237","textTraditional":"鄭武子賸之嬖許瑕求邑，無以與之。請外取，許之，故圍宋雍丘。宋皇瑗圍鄭師，每日遷舍，壘合。鄭師哭。子姚救之，大敗。二月甲戌，宋取鄭師于雍丘，使有能者無死，以郟張與鄭羅歸。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_237_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_237","textTraditional":"夏，楚人伐陳，陳即吳故也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_237_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_237","textTraditional":"宋公伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_237_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_237","textTraditional":"秋，吳城邗，溝通江、淮。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_237_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_237","textTraditional":"晉趙鞅卜救鄭，遇水適火，占諸史趙、史墨、史龜。史龜曰：「是謂沈陽，可以興兵，利以伐姜，不利子商。伐齊則可，敵宋不吉。」史墨曰：「盈，水名也；子，水位也。名位敵，不可干也。炎帝為火師，姜姓其後也。水勝火，伐姜則可。」史趙曰：「是謂如川之滿，不可游也。鄭方有罪，不可救也。救鄭則不吉，不知其他。」陽虎以周易筮之，遇泰之需，曰：「宋方吉，不可與也。微子啟，帝乙之元子也。宋、鄭，甥舅也。祉，祿也。若帝乙之元子歸妹而有吉祿，我安得吉焉？」乃止。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_237_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_237","textTraditional":"冬，吳子使來儆師伐齊。","sentenceOrder":14}],"overrides":{}}